@startuml
title Figura 18 - Módulo Visualización 3D: Mapbox GL JS 3D + A-Frame 360°

actor "Usuario\n(PDS/Solicitante)" as User
participant "Frontend\nPWA React" as FE
participant "Mapbox GL JS\n3D Engine" as MAPBOX
participant "A-Frame\n360 Viewer" as AFRAME
participant "Backend\nAPI" as BE
participant "MinIO S3" as S3

== Mapbox GL JS 3D: Exploración Geoespacial ==
User -> FE: Abre "Explorar Chambas"
FE -> MAPBOX: Inicializa mapa 3D\nStyle: streets-v11 + custom\nCenter: user location\nPitch: 45, Bearing: 0
MAPBOX -> MAPBOX: Carga tiles vectoriales\nTerrain: RGB DEM\nExtrusion: buildings 3D
FE -> BE: GET /solicitudes/?lat&lon&radio
BE -> DB: ST_DWithin + filtros
DB --> BE: GeoJSON FeatureCollection
BE --> FE: Chambas con geometría POINT
FE -> MAPBOX: Add source: geojson chambas
MAPBOX -> MAPBOX: Cluster layer:\n  radius: 50px, maxzoom: 14
MAPBOX -> MAPBOX: Heatmap layer:\n  weight: score_ml * (1/dist_km)\n  radius: 30px, intensity: 0.8
MAPBOX -> MAPBOX: 3D Extrusion:\n  circle-radius: sqrt(score)*10\n  circle-height: score*100
FE --> User: Mapa 3D interactivo\nNavegación: pitch, bearing, zoom

== Mapbox: Geocerca Dinámica (Publicación) ==
User -> FE: "Publicar Chamba" → Paso 2: Ubicación
FE -> MAPBOX: Draw mode: Polygon\nToolbar: draw, edit, delete
User -> MAPBOX: Dibuja polígono geocerca\nPuntos: [lat,lon] array
MAPBOX -> MAPBOX: Cálculo en cliente:\n  centroid = turf.centroid\n  radius_km = max_distance\n  bbox = turf.bbox
FE -> FE: Preview: area km2 + radio efectivo
User -> FE: Confirma geocerca → Siguiente
FE -> BE: POST /solicitudes/ {\n  geocerca: polygon_geojson,\n  centroid, radius_km, bbox\n}

== A-Frame 360: Captura Panorámica ==
User -> FE: Paso 3: "Capturar 360"
FE -> AFRAME: Inicializa escena A-Frame\nPhoto Sphere Viewer\nWebRTC getUserMedia
AFRAME -> AFRAME: Camera stream → texture\nGyroscope + accelerometer
User -> AFRAME: Mueve telefono 360
AFRAME -> AFRAME: Stitching frames\nEquirectangular 2:1 (4096x2048)
User -> FE: "Guardar panoramica"
FE -> FE: Canvas → base64 JPEG (0.8)
FE -> BE: POST /solicitudes/ {panorama_360_base64}
BE -> S3: Upload base64 → objeto MinIO
BE -> DB: Guardar URL + metadatos EXIF
BE --> FE: 201 {panorama_url}

== A-Frame 360: Inspección Evidencias (Ejecución) ==
User -> FE: Abre contrato → "Ver evidencias 360"
FE -> BE: GET /contratos/{id}/evidencias_360
BE -> DB: SELECT minio_url FROM evidencias\nWHERE formato=360
DB --> BE: URLs MinIO
BE --> FE: {panoramas: [url1, url2...]}
FE -> AFRAME: Carga panoramicas en secuencia\n<a-scene> + <a-sky> + animation
AFRAME -> AFRAME: Navegación VR:\n  Look-controls (mouse/touch/gyro)\n  Hotspots: marcadores GPS + timestamp\n  Medición: distancia entre puntos
User -> AFRAME: Inspecciona obra 360\nZoom + giro + hotspots
FE --> User: Evidencia entrada/salida verificada\nContexto espacial inmersivo

note right of MAPBOX
  MAPBOX GL JS 3D:
  • Vector tiles + RGB DEM terrain
  • Building extrusion 3D
  • Clustering + Heatmap dinámico
  • Geocerca: turf.js (centroid, bbox, area)
  • Fallback: SwiftShader WebGL
  • Offline: MBTiles cache
end note

note right of AFRAME
  A-FRAME 360:
  • Photo Sphere Viewer stitching
  • Equirectangular 4096x2048
  • WebRTC camera + gyroscope
  • Hotspots GPS + timestamp
  • Medición distancia en esfera
  • WebXR ready (VR headset)
end note

@enduml